package dev.cajeta.coverage;

/**
 * Marker class for the dev.cajeta.coverage plugin package.
 *
 * The package's real machinery is the sidecar manifest's plugin block: the
 * build tool spawns `details.plugin.binary` (the coco engine's plugin-host)
 * and speaks the subprocess protocol with it. This class exists so the
 * package archive has honest content and a place for package-level docs:
 * coverage instrumentation, reporting and gating are provided by
 * cajeta-coco (dev.cajeta.coco), which this plugin adapts to the build
 * tool's action contracts.
 */
public class Plugin {
    /** Plugin protocol major version this package speaks. */
    public static int32 protocolVersion() { return 1; }
}
